<!-- G11a-2 fixture, written by hand for the parity harness of PPP (no source music): a D.C. al Fine whose Fine sits at the end of bar 3, inside the first repeat. Bar 1 opens the repeat, bar 4 is the first ending (with the backward repeat), bar 5 the second, the D.C. ends bar 7. Written order: 1 2 3 4 | 1 2 3 5 6 7. As an engraver reads it: 1 2 3 4 | 1 2 3 5 6 7 | 1 2 3 (Fine): a Fine passed on the way there is not a stop. -->
